sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent
  participant Service as External service
  participant Authority as Authoritative status source
  Agent->>Service: Submit action with operation key
  Note over Agent,Service: Timeout. Effect unknown
  Agent->>Authority: Query status for that operation key
  alt Committed
    Authority-->>Agent: Receipt or state confirms effect
    Note right of Agent: Record effect. Do not retry
  else Confirmed absent and fenced
    Authority-->>Agent: Current absence and stable key or fence blocks late commit
    Note right of Agent: Retry only when authorized
  else Still ambiguous
    Authority-->>Agent: Stale, incomplete, or inconclusive result
    Note right of Agent: Stop and escalate
  end
